"
=====================
Fuel Level Monitoring
=====================
Reads the fuel level and checks it fits the tank.

Requirements
------------
1. :req:`VMCFUE00001`
2. :req:`VMCFUE00005`
"

(Precondition "Demo running in normal mode"
  (demo-in-mode? :normal)
  :heal (start-demo :normal))

"
Steps
-----
"

(set-reading :fuel-level 40)
(fuel-level-ok? (reading :fuel-level))
